  "adapterDelta": {
    "cloudrun": "Reuse existing v2 service primitive; explicit identity, immutable digest, external SA instead of generated names/tag image/IAM creation.",
    "appengine": "Reuse existing standard version primitive and selected-provider flexible primitive, external source bucket/SA, source-bound closed app.yaml projection. Reviewed exclusive nondefault service contract uses service-delete true/noop false/destroy-before-create with downtime; shared history/inventory/single-writer/saved-plan guard is mandatory and activation remains blocked.",
    "other": "Narrow selected-provider native roots own child workload/artifact resources only; no parent provisioning or auto-import."
  },
  "destroyCaveat": "Reviewed whole-service deletion is valid only for historically verified exclusive nondefault services. Traffic resource Delete remains state-only; provider Create wait errors can leave live survivors absent from native state.",
